  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 287526871040
    m_Localized: Voice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1820355600572416
    m_Localized: medical records
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1820359228645376
    m_Localized: Introduce yourself, explain the purpose and feeding procedure to
      get the patient's cooperation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1820364756738048
    m_Localized: Instruct the patient on posture and things to note during feeding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1820367973769216
    m_Localized: Greetings, Explanations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1928428226863104
    m_Localized: Check List
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1931559274799104
    m_Localized: Cap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1931563582349312
    m_Localized: Cloak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1931566623219712
    m_Localized: Glove
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1931569907359744
    m_Localized: Stethoscope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1940842854998016
    m_Localized: Ensure adequate cap, mask, and gown according to basic aseptic regulations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1942873325953024
    m_Localized: Mask
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1944441630744576
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1945117614137344
    m_Localized: 6-step hand washing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054517716672512
    m_Localized: Set up a screen to create a private space, respecting the patient
      before performing the procedure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2056538582671360
    m_Localized: Select medical equipment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2057929854279680
    m_Localized: Remind and encourage the patient to cooperate to make the catheter
      insertion process easier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2058709357289472
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2062041572433920
    m_Localized: Cover the screen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2062190138875904
    m_Localized: Set up a screen to create a private space, respecting the patient
      before performing the procedure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2063126567575552
    m_Localized: Bring the prepared cart/tray to the patient's bedside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2064080415219712
    m_Localized: Bed lift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2064659099148288
    m_Localized: Place the patient on his back with his head elevated 30-60 degrees
      (Fowler's position) to avoid choking and facilitate manipulation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2065547280769024
    m_Localized: Remind and encourage the patient to cooperate to make the catheter
      insertion process easier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2068371070771200
    m_Localized: Catheter Measurement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2068409360572416
    m_Localized: Hold the catheter properly (pen grip) and firmly insert the catheter
      into the nose to about 10cm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2070373431500800
    m_Localized: Depress the tongue to check, if the tube does not coil, continue
      to thread in rhythm with swallowing and bring the tube to the marked line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2070555023892480
    m_Localized: Inserting a tube into the stomach
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2071500457762816
    m_Localized: "Th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n 1 trong 3 c\xE1ch (h\xFAt d\u1ECBch, nghe \xE2m
      thanh, ki\u1EC3m tra s\u1EE7i b\u1ECDt) \u0111\u1EC3 x\xE1c \u0111\u1ECBnh
      ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn \u0111\u1EA7u \u1ED1ng \u0111\xE3 v\xE0o d\u1EA1 d\xE0y"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2071707123703808
    m_Localized: Pump air & listen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2071709149552640
    m_Localized: Gastric juice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2071710609170432
    m_Localized: No foaming
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2072378757603328
    m_Localized: Pipe Fixation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2072445044383744
    m_Localized: Use tape to firmly fix the catheter to the nose and cheek/forehead
      to avoid displacement during feeding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2072730705846272
    m_Localized: Pipe Coating
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2072799463071744
    m_Localized: Rinse the tube with boiled water (10-15ml), then slowly inject the
      food (after defecation) as ordered, and finally rinse the tube again with water
      (20ml) to avoid clogging.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2073813800968192
    m_Localized: Feeding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2073998476173312
    m_Localized: Rinse the tube with boiled water (10-15ml), then slowly inject the
      food (after defecation) as ordered, and finally rinse the tube again with water
      (20ml) to avoid clogging.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2074912586981376
    m_Localized: Rinse the tube with boiled water (10-15ml), then slowly inject the
      food (after defecation) as ordered, and finally rinse the tube again with water
      (20ml) to avoid clogging.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2075008355524608
    m_Localized: Second Coating of Pipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2075174655483904
    m_Localized: Remove the Tape
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2075386618830848
    m_Localized: "R\xFAt \u1ED1ng nh\u1EB9 nh\xE0ng v\xE0 t\u1EEB t\u1EEB. Khi \u1ED1ng
      g\u1EA7n r\xFAt h\u1EBFt (15 - 20cm), k\u1EB9p ho\u1EB7c g\u1EADp \u1ED1ng
      l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EC3 tr\xE1nh d\u1ECBch d\u1EA1 d\xE0y ch\u1EA3y ng\u01B0\u1EE3c
      ra ngo\xE0i."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2076597136908288
    m_Localized: Post-meal care
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2076634654957568
    m_Localized: Clean mouth and nose, remove cotton towels and plastic to clean
      the patient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2077315570851840
    m_Localized: Keep the patient's head elevated 30 - 60 degrees for 30 - 60 minutes
      to avoid reflux and monitor closely for any unusual signs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2077666885754880
    m_Localized: Follow up 30-60 minutes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2077973665538048
    m_Localized: Collect and sort dirty tools, remove gloves according to procedure
      to ensure hygiene.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2078115147800576
    m_Localized: Clean up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2079098879860736
    m_Localized: Perform hand sanitizer after finishing work and cleaning up tools.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2098398739030016
    m_Localized: Open and record the patient's personal information and medical history.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2135925210472448
    m_Localized: Finnish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2136811982807040
    m_Localized: I. Administration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2137280675307520
    m_Localized: 'Full name (printed):'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2137442244091904
    m_Localized: Date of birth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2137447424057344
    m_Localized: Age
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139771584372736
    m_Localized: 'Gender:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2140607928590336
    m_Localized: 'Nation:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2140888498167808
    m_Localized: 'Residential address:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2140973554458624
    m_Localized: 'HICN:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2140975425118208
    m_Localized: 'CIN:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2141441768808448
    m_Localized: Reason
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2141479513350144
    m_Localized: I. Type and quantity of food
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2141740868820992
    m_Localized: 'Fill in the type of food and the amount of food you want to pump
      in:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2141849585180672
    m_Localized: 'History '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2141851325816832
    m_Localized: 'Date/Time '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2141852844154880
    m_Localized: 'Current status:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2227147421962240
    m_Localized: Sanitary cover
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4018520810577920
    m_Localized: Click the horizontal line to open the sterile package.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4381814322880512
    m_Localized: "ti\u1EBFng"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4697512467226624
    m_Localized: Use a syringe to aspirate fluid from the stomach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4697540929773568
    m_Localized: Dip the outer tip of the catheter into a cup of boiled water; if
      no bubbles appear, it indicates that the catheter tip has not been mistakenly
      inserted into the trachea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4718394099097600
    m_Localized: Using a syringe, inject about 20-30 ml of air while simultaneously
      placing the stethoscope over the patient's epigastric region to listen. A gurgling
      sound is sufficient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8766105542905856
    m_Localized: Clean Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
